English

This isn't a "password wasn't set" issue — Ubuntu cloud images disable password-based SSH login by default, allowing only key-based authentication. So even if you set a password for the ubuntu user, ssh will default to trying public-key auth and get rejected. The correct way to get passwordless login from ziqiao-asm100 into node2/node3 is to add ziqiao-asm100's SSH public key to authorized_keys on both VMs.

